OL,3,GNEWSAJury discharged in trial of
OL,4,Ateacher accused of sex with pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury in the trial of a PE teacher
OL,7,Faccused of having sex with a
OL,8,F16-year-old pupil has been discharged.
OL,10,FBronwen James, 30, of Chippenham,
OL,11,FWiltshire, has been on trial of four
OL,12,Fcharges of sexual activity with a boy
OL,13,Fat Bitterne Park School in Southampton,
OL,14,FHampshire.
OL,16,FThe jury was sent home by the judge
OL,17,Fearlier during the opening day of the
OL,18,Ftrial. The case has been adjourned
OL,19,Funtil Thursday, when a new jury is set
OL,20,Fto be sworn in.
OL,22,FJames denies the charges.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
